{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:54 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"深水埗野猴疑口吐白泡 途人報案兼通知愛協 人員到場爬樹離開。Google Map截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76003abe0f1a5208d185c60279a69760/2026-10/2026-10-18_5_41_39.png\"/><p>深水埗發現受傷動物。今日（18日）凌晨1時許，兩名途人先後行經大埔道338號一個油站對開時，發現一隻野猴口吐白泡，於是報案求助，並通知愛護動物協會。</p><p>愛協人員接獲通知後到場了解，惟野猴已爬上樹離開。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T21:58:26.049224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:54:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T22:37:33.932530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T21:57:33.381395+00:00","content_hash":"92014a56dac3cf5a6ed052b7e4b8aa9cfe698d9916ec19f39fd7ed85b6294b07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}